  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN 2023 Renewable Energy Short Course</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The course will provide 32 participants with the required base knowledge to successfully project manage new renewable energy capacity developments in their home country. It is an intensive course for engineers and managers (from both state-owned enterprises and energy development companies) from Cambodia, Lao PDR, Viet Nam, Philippines, Indonesia and Timor-Leste to upskill for future&#xa0;Renewable Energy development projects, such as Solar, Wind, Biofuel, Geothermal or Hydro projects.</narrative>
  </description>
